{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>And YHWH turned.</b> He turned and looked upon him, so that fire came down and consumed his meal-offering, in the manner of accepted offerings, and in the manner of what is written (Psalms 20:4): ״יזכור כל מנחותיך ועולתך ידשנה סלה״ — 'May He remember all your meal-offerings and make fat your burnt-offering, selah'; and He did not do so with that of Cain."], :book :genesis, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:10:06.503623025Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}